  "description": "Executable evidence for ak.vector.actor_private_events.submit.v1 (zh/models/actor-private-effects.md section 2.1, decisions 0110 and 0114). Every case starts from an empty Station and runs its variants in order. A variant authors one Event of event_kind whose payload is the named schema_validation_cases instance with payload_mutations applied, signs it as signer (an Account on world.local_station_id unless signer_station says otherwise) and submits it on operation_id; a retry variant resubmits an earlier variant's Event, either as identical canonical bytes or re-signed over the same content so that event_id is unchanged and the bytes differ. private_writes counts committed private transactions (value projection plus exact-retry ledger row); realm_commits counts RealmCommits produced. A rejected variant MUST leave every private register and ledger exactly as before, and a replay MUST return the outcome recorded for outcome_of.",
